porque Yahvé me sostiene.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"No tendré miedo de decenas de miles de personas","poem":1},{"text":"que se han puesto en mi contra por todos lados.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"¡Levántate, Yahvé!","poem":1},{"text":"¡Sálvame, Dios mío!","poem":2},{"text":"Porque has golpeado a todos mis enemigos en el pómulo.","poem":1},{"text":"Has roto los dientes de los malvados.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"La salvación pertenece a Yahvé.","poem":1},{"text":"Que tu bendición sea para tu pueblo. Selah.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"La palabra hebrea traducida como “Dios” es “אֱלֹהִ֑ים” (Elohim).","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}